[24.089277, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[2G\u001b[38;5;174m▝▝   ▝▝ \u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;241m~/b/billing\u001b[24G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;5;255m\u001b[38;5;248m❯ \u001b[38;5;16mFinance says our money rounding is wrong: div_cents() in app/money.py \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mdrops fractions of a cent, but amounts must round half up (for example, \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16m7% tax on 1050 cents must be 74\u001b[35Gcents, not 73). te\u001b[54Gts/test_money.py pins \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe required behaviour; you can run it\u001b[42Gwith\u001b[47G\u001b[38;5;105mpython3 -m pytest \u001b[39m          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;105mtests/test_money.py\u001b[38;5;16m.\u001b[24GFix it and\u001b[35Gt\u001b[37Gll me when it\u001b[51Gis done. Do not commit; \u001b[39m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16mdo not push.\u001b[39m                                                  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[39m I'll fix the rounding issue in \u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m. Let me start by examining the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btest\u001b[8Gfile\u001b[13Gand\u001b[17Gcurrent\u001b[25Gimplementation.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mRead \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files \u001b[17G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow I can see\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Gissue.\u001b[28GThe\u001b[32Gtest\u001b[37Gexpects\u001b[45G\u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents(7350, 100)\u001b[66G\u001b[39mto\u001b[69Greturn\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B74\u001b[6G(rounding\u001b[16G73.5\u001b[21Gup),\u001b[26Gbut\u001b[30Gthe\u001b[34Gcurrent\u001b[42Gimplementation\u001b[57Guses\u001b[62G\u001b[38;5;105m//\u001b[65G\u001b[39mwhich\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gtruncates\u001b[13Gto 73.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI'll fix this using\u001b[23Gthe\u001b[27Ghalf-up\u001b[35Grounding\u001b[44Gformula:\u001b[53G\u001b[38;5;105m(total_cents + divisor \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B// 2) // divisor\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(\u001b]8;id=19rw1ia;file:///root/b/billing/app/money.py\u0007app/money.py\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
